{
  "id": "lost-link-launch-tournament",
  "name": "Lost Link launch tournament",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "The tournaments held to launch Lost Link (ロストリンク), an enhancement pack of the LEGEND series released on 16 April 2010. From that day Gym Challenge (ジム☆チャレンジ) shops of the official Pokémon Card Gym network held launch tournaments in two leagues, one for elementary school children and younger and an open one, where every player got Zangoose 056/L-P with a holo basic Energy and the top finishers got Lost Remover 057/L-P among other prizes. Pokémon Challenge Hiroba events and Pokémon Centers held launch battles too, with the same two cards, both drawn by Wataru Kawahara and carrying the Lost Link logo on their pictures."
  },
